{"name":"Belly Flop","hex":"#00817f","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"belly flop","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A style of diving into a body of water in which the surface impact is made mostly by one's abdomen.","A similar move performed on a trampoline."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To perform this type of dive.","To perform this type of trampolining move."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/belly_flop"}],"entries":[{"title":"Belly flop","blocks":[{"text":"A belly flop is a dive in which the front of the body strikes the surface of the water horizontally. They are often executed accidentally, although several contests have been held."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Belly_flop","wikidata":"Q13629225"},{"title":"Belly (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Belly is a 1998 American crime drama film written and directed by music video director Hype Williams, in his feature film directing debut. Filmed in New York City, the film stars rappers Nas and DMX in their film debut, alongside Taral Hicks, Method Man, T-Boz and an uncredited cameo from Sean Paul and Mr. Vegas."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/db/Belly_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Belly_(film)","wikidata":"Q646077"}],"images":[],"sounds":{"belly flop":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/65/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-PerfectSoundWhatever-belly_flop.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/65/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-PerfectSoundWhatever-belly_flop.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-PerfectSoundWhatever-belly_flop.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/65/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-PerfectSoundWhatever-belly_flop.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Perfe